NNAAMMEE
     hhpptt2277xxxx — HighPoint RocketRAID 27xx SAS 6Gb/s HBA card driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, place the following line in your
     kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee hhpptt2277xxxx

     Alternatively, to load the driver as a module at boot time, place the
     following line in loader.conf(5):

           hpt27xx_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The hhpptt2277xxxx driver provides support for HighPoint's RocketRAID 27xx based
     RAID controller.

     These devices support SAS disk drives and provide RAID0 (striping), RAID1
     (mirroring), and RAID5 functionality.

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The hhpptt2277xxxx driver supports the following SAS controllers:

     ••   HighPoint's RocketRAID 271x series
     ••   HighPoint's RocketRAID 272x series
     ••   HighPoint's RocketRAID 274x series
     ••   HighPoint's RocketRAID 276x series
     ••   HighPoint's RocketRAID 278x series

NNOOTTEESS
     The hhpptt2277xxxx driver only works on the i386 and amd64 platforms as it re‐
     quires a binary blob object from the manufacturer which they only supply
     for these platforms.  The hhpptt2277xxxx driver does _n_o_t work on i386 with
     pae(4) enabled.

SSEEEE AALLSSOO
     kld(4), kldload(8), loader(8)

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The hhpptt2277xxxx device driver first appeared in FreeBSD 10.0.

